# Whitelist build context for the custom Airflow and Superset images
# (infrastructure/{airflow,superset}/Dockerfile, context = repo root): only
# files the image builds actually need enter the context, keeping it small
# and the builds independent of local tooling state (.venv, caches, git
# history).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!src/**
